FamilyTree.person({"id":"bertha_dk","name":"Bertha Alida Theresia Dekeyser","dates":"b. 7 Aug 1901 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Dekeyser","family":"dekeyser","sex":"f","born":"7 Aug 1901 Oostende","order":"1901-08-07","branch":"DeKeyser","line":"de-keyser","father":"edouard_dk","mother":"louise_bocklandt","source":"Geneanet; Ancestry","note":"Source detail: Ancestry / Geneanet West-Vlaanderen civil-registration index (Oostende birth act, 1901; original data Rijksarchief)\n\nA newly-found child of Édouard Dekeyser × Louise Bocklandt — born 7 Aug 1901 Oostende, three months after her parents' 4 May 1901 marriage. Her birth act names both parents (Eduardus de Keyser × Louisa Maria Bocklandt). Sister of Jérôme (1897), Gustavus (1899), Maria (1902) and the two infants Angela Luciana (†1903) and Cesar Mauritius (†1905). Her own later life is not yet traced."});
