FamilyTree.person({"id":"charleseugene_t","name":"Charles Eugène Thumas","dates":"1850 Grez-Doiceau – 9 Apr 1851 Grez-Doiceau","confidence":"sup","surname":"Thumas","family":"thumas","born":"1850 Grez-Doiceau","order":"1850","died":"9 Apr 1851 Grez-Doiceau","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","father":"georges2_t","mother":"joostens","source":"The children of Georges Thumas x Marie Catherine Joostens at Grez-Doiceau, 1835-1868","note":"The youngest known child of [[georges2_t]] and [[joostens]], and the only one of them\nthis tree can follow to the end. He was born in 1850 and **died at Grez-Doiceau on 9 April\n1851**, an infant.\n\nHe is here on two independent indexes rather than one. FamilySearch's transcription of the\nBrabant civil registration names him with both parents (S25); AGATHA's Grez-Doiceau death acts\ncarry the same entry — *9 April 1851, Charles Eugène Thumas, father Georges*. Two venues, one\nchild.\n\nThe birth is a year and not a date because neither index gives more.\n\n`sup`: no register image read. His death act would give the day of his birth and probably his\nfather's trade and address."});
