FamilyTree.person({"id":"crabbe","name":"Marie Louise Crabbé","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Crabbé","family":"crabbe","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"jean_t","name":"Jean Thumas"}],"note":"Jean Thumas (1907–1995) married Marie Louise Crabbé (Geneanet, marcelcroon tree). If François is their son — the inferred, privacy-sealed link — she is his mother. Her own dates and parents aren’t recorded in any tree or reachable record: the ~1930s Kraainem marriage sits inside the privacy window, and Crabbé is a common Brabant/Walloon name. A family memorial card for Jean or Marie Louise would name her parents."});
