FamilyTree.person({"id":"elodia","name":"Elodia Octavia Bostyn","dates":"1908 – 1997 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bostyn","family":"bostyn","born":"1908","order":"1908","died":"1997 Oostende","occupation":"werkster (labourer)","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bundervoet","father":"henricus_bostyn","mother":"judith_cappaert","spouses":[{"id":"alphonsus","name":"Alphonsus Bernardus Bundervoet"}],"source":"Familiekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial card — Alfons Bundervoet, d. Oostende 11 Mar 1980; Geneanet","note":"Source detail: Fauconier tree (Geneanet); Oostende marriage act 334, 1930\n\nMarcel’s mother. Oostende birth act 1013/1908. Her Bostyn/Cappaert family came from the Bruges area (Varsenare, Oostkamp).\n\nCORROBORATED (July 2026) as a wife: she is named as the partner on her husband's\nmemorial-card record ([[alphonsus]], d. Oostende 11 March 1980), which puts the marriage on\nan independent record rather than on family memory alone. The card gives no dates of her\nown."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"emma_vincke","name":"Emma Celesta Vincke","dates":"23 Jan 1880 Diksmuide – 6 Oct 1974 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Vincke","family":"vincke","born":"23 Jan 1880 Diksmuide","order":"1880-01-23","died":"6 Oct 1974 Oostende","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","father":"lucien_vincke","mother":"ludovica_vanald","spouses":[{"id":"eduardus_vi","name":"Eduardus Van Iseghem","detail":"m. Oostende, 28 Sep 1907"}],"source":"Memorial card — Emma Celesta Vincke, d. Oostende 6 October 1974; gverdievel (Guy Verdievel)","note":"Lived to 94 — the longest-lived in this cluster — outliving her husband by nearly 30 years. Daughter of Lucien Vincke & Ludovica Vanalderweireldt.\n\nCORROBORATED (July 2026). A Familiekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial-card record gives\nher birth at Diksmuide on 23 January 1880, her death at Oostende on 6 October 1974, and\nher partner as Eduard Van Iseghem — every field as held here, and the marriage to\n[[eduardus_vi]] with it. She had rested on the gverdievel tree alone.\n\nFRONTIER — her birth act is indexed and has been seen, but not read. AGATHA's index for\nthe West-Vlaanderen civil birth registers carries it as Diksmuide, **akte nr. 14, act\ndate 24 January 1880**, child *Emma Celesta Vincke*, born Diksmuide — one day after the\nbirth date held here, which is the ordinary gap between a birth and its declaration.\nPulling the act itself would move her birth, and her parents [[lucien_vincke]] ×\n[[ludovica_vanald]], off a memorial card and a member tree and onto civil registration.\nIt needs a logged-in AGATHA session: the act detail pages are public by direct id, but\nsearching is not, and this act's id was never recorded. A screenshot taken of the index\nmodal was discarded as unusable — it was cropped so that parents from a *different*\nact showed beneath Emma's entry."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"engel_antonius_vincke","name":"Engel Antonius Vincke","dates":"b. 17 Feb 1807 Diksmuide","confidence":"sup","surname":"Vincke","family":"vincke","born":"17 Feb 1807 Diksmuide","order":"1807-02-17","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","father":"antonius_vincke","mother":"anne_peperstraete","spouses":[{"id":"virginia_leynseele","name":"Virginia Coleta Leynseele"}],"source":"bartvanhooren (Bart Vanhooren)","note":"Of Diksmuide; married twice — our line runs through his 2nd wife, Virginia Leynseele (their son Lucien, 1840)."});
