FamilyTree.person({"id":"joannes_stockman","name":"Joannes Stockman","dates":"~1646 – 1696","confidence":"sup","surname":"Stockman","family":"stockman","born":"~1646","order":"1646","died":"1696","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bundervoet","spouses":[{"id":"guillielma_dellaert","name":"Guillielma (Willemijne) Dellaert"}],"source":"paulderidder","note":"Father of Livina Stockman (~1688–1744), who married Joannes Bundervoet (~1682) — so a\ndirect ancestor through her sons Christoffel and Pieter.\n\nFrom the paulderidder ancestry chart of his grandson Pieter Bundervoet, which gives the\ncouple as Joannes Stockman (~1646–1696) × Guillielma \"Willemijne\" Dellaert (1650–1694).\nLivina's record carried no parents at all before this.\n\nFRONTIER: his own parents, and the Stockman–Dellaert marriage, in the Evergem registers\naround 1670."});
