FamilyTree.person({"id":"joostens","name":"Marie Catharina Joostens","dates":"1810 – 10 Jun 1857 Grez-Doiceau","confidence":"doc","surname":"Joostens","family":"joostens","born":"1810","order":"1810","died":"10 Jun 1857 Grez-Doiceau","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","father":"guillaume_joostens","mother":"jeanne_deconninck","spouses":[{"id":"georges2_t","name":"Georges Thumas","detail":"m. Grez-Doiceau, 17 Feb 1835"}],"source":"Death act nr. 35 — Marie Catherine Joostens, Grez-Doiceau, 10 June 1857 (read on AGATHA); Death act of Marie Catherine Joostens, Grez-Doiceau, 10 June 1857","note":"DOCUMENTED (July 2026) by her own death act — Grez-Doiceau, 10 June 1857, the year this\nrecord already held — which gives two things the tree did not have at all: her **parents**,\nGuillaume Joostens and Jeanne Marie Deconninck, and her **birthplace**,\nWoluwe-Saint-Lambert. Her husband Georges Thumas is named as the survivor.\n\nHer parents are a documented frontier rather than a graft: they are named here plainly, and\nadding them is the obvious next step, but neither has a record yet and nothing beyond this\nact has been read about them.\n\nACT READ (July 2026). Her own death act — Grez-Doiceau, akte nr. 35, registered 11 June\n1857 and giving the death as the **10th** — read at the archive and saved\n([[joostens-1857-death-grez-doiceau]]). It fixes the day where this record had only the year,\nconfirms her birthplace of Woluwe-Saint-Lambert from the act itself, gives her occupation as\n*ménagère*, and names her parents [[guillaume_joostens]] and [[jeanne_deconninck]], who until\na pass ago were not in this tree at all.\n\nHer stated age of 47 puts her birth in 1809–10, which agrees with the 1810 held here."});
