FamilyTree.person({"id":"louis_steenkiste","name":"Louis Steenkiste","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Steenkiste","family":"steenkiste","branch":"Devriendt","line":"devriendt","spouses":[{"id":"reine_storms","name":"Reine Storms"}],"source":"wernero (Werner Osaer)","note":"FRONTIER above — father of Lucia Theresia Steenkiste (1767). Dates not recovered."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"louise_bocklandt","name":"Louise Marie Bocklandt","dates":"31 Dec 1877 Hamme (Oost-Vlaanderen) – 15 Jul 1946 Oostende","confidence":"doc","surname":"Bocklandt","family":"bocklandt","born":"31 Dec 1877 Hamme (Oost-Vlaanderen)","order":"1877-12-31","died":"15 Jul 1946 Oostende","branch":"DeKeyser","line":"de-keyser","father":"edouard_bocklandt","mother":"marie_vanbergen","spouses":[{"id":"edouard_dk","name":"Édouard Dekeyser","detail":"m. 4 May 1901 · divorced ~1923 · legitimized their two eldest children"},{"id":"petrus_blomme","name":"Petrus Blomme"}],"source":"Memorial-card record — Louisa-Maria Bocklandt, d. Oostende 15 July 1946; wete1998 (Erik Bekaert) — Hamme (O-Vl) specialist; Rijksarchief AGATHA — Belgian State Archives search robot","note":"Source detail: Rijksarchief AGATHA (parents on her record); Geneanet tree wete1998 (Erik Bekaert); Édouard's 1946 marriage act (records their divorce)\n\nBorn 31 Dec 1877 in Hamme (OOST-VLAANDEREN, Waasland) — the SAME town as her husband Édouard Dekeyser (both Hamme natives who moved to Oostende). This is the true source of the long 'Hamme' confusion: it was the couple's shared birth-town, not Hamme-Merchtem and not a marriage place. Married Édouard 4 May 1901 (the marriage legitimized their two eldest children); they later DIVORCED (~1923, decree Rechtbank van eersten aanleg Brugge — per Édouard's 1946 remarriage act). Died 1946 Oostende, buried at Stene. Her Bocklandt family is a Hamme (O-Vl) / Waasland family documented back to the 1760s (see her parents and the Bocklandt / Van Bergen ancestors).\n\nSHE REMARRIED (July 2026). A Familiekunde Westkust memorial-card record ([[S17]]) gives her\ndeath as **15 July 1946 at Oostende** — the tree had only the year — with her birthplace Hamme,\nand names her partner as **Petrus Blomme**.\n\nNot Édouard. She and [[edouard_dk]] divorced around 1923, and this is the first sign of what\nshe did afterwards: she married again. The chronology is quietly striking — Édouard remarried\nLeontine Schreel at Oostende on 9 May 1946, and Louise died nine weeks later, on 15 July, a\nBlomme.\n\nPetrus Blomme has no record here: the card names him and nothing more. FRONTIER — the\nBocklandt–Blomme marriage act, which would date the remarriage and give his parents. It is\npost-1923 Oostende, so it sits at the Stadsarchief rather than in AGATHA."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"lucia_maene","name":"Lucia Amelia Maene","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Maene","family":"maene","sex":"f","branch":"Vanstechelman","line":"vanstechelman","spouses":[{"id":"leontius_v","name":"Leontius Ivo Vanstechelman","detail":"m. Oostende, 20 Aug 1922"}],"source":"België, West-Vlaanderen, burgerlijke stand, 1582-1950","note":"Bride of [[leontius_v]] in his Oostende marriage registration of 20 August 1922.\n\nNo dates of her own: the act is indexed under the event, not read as an image.\nFRONTIER — reading it would give her age and her parents."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"lucia_steenkiste","name":"Lucia Theresia Steenkiste","dates":"b. 28 Oct 1767 Oudenburg","confidence":"sup","surname":"Steenkiste","family":"steenkiste","born":"28 Oct 1767 Oudenburg","order":"1767-10-28","branch":"Devriendt","line":"devriendt","father":"louis_steenkiste","mother":"reine_storms","spouses":[{"id":"henricus_j_ramon","name":"Henricus Josephus Ramon","detail":"m. Mariakerke, 18 Nov 1806"}],"source":"wernero (Werner Osaer)","note":"Daughter of Louis Steenkiste & Reine Storms; mother of Pierre Ramon."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"lucien_vincke","name":"Lucien Julianus Vincke","dates":"b. 26 Mar 1840 Diksmuide","confidence":"sup","surname":"Vincke","family":"vincke","born":"26 Mar 1840 Diksmuide","order":"1840-03-26","occupation":"metserdiener (mason's assistant)","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","father":"engel_antonius_vincke","mother":"virginia_leynseele","spouses":[{"id":"ludovica_vanald","name":"Ludovica Maria Vanalderweireldt","detail":"m. Diksmuide, 24 May 1865"}],"source":"bartvanhooren (Bart Vanhooren)","note":"A mason's assistant; son of Engel Antonius Vincke & Virginia Leynseele.\n\nFRONTIER — a probable second daughter, not grafted. AGATHA's index of the Diksmuide\ncivil birth registers carries an act of **8 October 1873** for a child *Romanie Elodie\nVincke*, whose father is given as *Vincke Lucien Julien* and mother as *Vanalderweireldt\nLudovica Maria*. Both parents match this couple by full name, in the commune where they\nmarried on 24 May 1865, and the date falls between that marriage and [[emma_vincke]]'s\nbirth in 1880 — so she would be Emma's elder sister, and this couple's known children\nwould go from one to two.\n\nIt stays a frontier rather than a link because the act has not been read: this is an\nindex row, and *Lucien Julien* is not quite the *Lucien Julianus* recorded here. The act\nitself would settle both, and reaching it needs a logged-in AGATHA session."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovica_bossin","name":"Ludovica Bossin","dates":"b. Sint-Stevens-Woluwe","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bossin","family":"bossin","born":"Sint-Stevens-Woluwe","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","father":"guilielmus_bossin","mother":"peremans","spouses":[{"id":"swaelens","name":"Joannes Baptista Julianus Swaelens","detail":"m. Alsemberg, 17 Feb 1884"}],"source":"Birth declarations at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe for three children of Guilielmus Bossin x Peremans, 1847-1853","note":"Younger sister of [[bossin]], and the third known child of [[guilielmus_bossin]] and\n[[peremans]]. Her birth was declared at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe on **5 October 1853**; the birth\nitself will have been a day or two earlier, which is why that sits in `raw` rather than in a\ndate field.\n\nShe married **Joannes Baptista Julianus Swaelens** at **Alsemberg on 17 February 1884**, at\nabout thirty. The marriage index names her parents as *Guilielmus Bossin* and *Joanna Maria\nPeremans* — a fourth spelling of her mother's forename, after the *Joanna Catharina Jacoba* of\nher mother's own act, the *Anna Catharina* of her sister's 1872 act, and the *Anna Catharina*\nof these birth declarations. One woman, four clerks.\n\nThat variation is why the marriage is attached at `sup` and not more. The birth row and the\nmarriage row agree on the surname pair, the father's forename and a consistent age, which is\nenough to record — but the register images would settle whether the 1853 child and the 1884\nbride are the same Ludovica.\n\nFRONTIER: both register images, and any children of the Swaelens marriage."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovica_ellebout","name":"Ludovica Prudentia Ellebout","dates":"b. 29 Apr 1765 Diksmuide","confidence":"sup","surname":"Ellebout","family":"ellebout","born":"29 Apr 1765 Diksmuide","order":"1765-04-29","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"ludovicus_dutreeuw","name":"Ludovicus Emanuel Dutreeuw","detail":"m. Diksmuide, 27 May 1807"}],"source":"bartvanhooren (Bart Vanhooren)","note":"Daughter of Ferdinand Ellebout & Catherine Millecam; married at 42 a husband about sixteen years younger."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovica_vanald","name":"Ludovica Maria Vanalderweireldt","dates":"23 Nov 1845 Diksmuide – 1914","confidence":"sup","surname":"Vanalderweireldt","family":"vanalderweireldt","born":"23 Nov 1845 Diksmuide","order":"1845-11-23","died":"1914","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","father":"carolus_vanald","mother":"eugenia_dutreeuw","spouses":[{"id":"lucien_vincke","name":"Lucien Julianus Vincke","detail":"m. Diksmuide, 24 May 1865"}],"source":"bartvanhooren (Bart Vanhooren)","note":"Daughter of Carolus Vanalderweireldt & Eugenia Dutreeuw; mother of Emma Celesta Vincke (1880–1974)."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovicus_bossin79","name":"Ludovicus Bossin","dates":"b. 5 Dec 1879 Sint-Stevens-Woluwe","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bossin","family":"bossin","sex":"m","born":"5 Dec 1879 Sint-Stevens-Woluwe","order":"1879-12-05","occupation":"polijster (polisher)","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","father":"jbbossin","mother":"maria_wolf","spouses":[{"id":"misabella_t","name":"Maria Isabella Helena Thumas","detail":"m. Kraainem, 10 Apr 1900"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 3 — Ludovicus Bossin × Maria Isabella Helena Thumas, Kraainem, 10 April 1900","note":"Married [[misabella_t]] at Kraainem on **10 April 1900** (act nr. 3, S28). Born at\n**Sint-Stevens-Woluwe on 5 December 1879**, a *polijster*, son of [[jbbossin]] — dead since\n1887 — and [[maria_wolf]], who kept an inn there.\n\n**He shares his wife's mother's surname, and that is left as a question, not an answer.** His\nbride's mother is [[bossin]], Antonia Bossin of Sint-Stevens-Woluwe, and the witnesses at this\nwedding include two more Bossins, hoveniers of Zaventem and Kraainem. Sint-Stevens-Woluwe is a\nsmall commune and the families are very likely connected — but nothing in the act says how,\nand a shared surname in one village is not a link. No parent line is drawn.\n\n**Note the id.** He is not [[ludovica_bossin]], Antonia's sister born 1853; the two ids differ\nby a single letter and the people differ by a generation and a sex. This one carries his birth\nyear for exactly that reason.\n\nFRONTIER: his parents' marriage, which would say whether [[jbbossin]] descends from the same\nBossins as Antonia."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovicus_dutreeuw","name":"Ludovicus Emanuel Dutreeuw","dates":"b. 9 Nov 1781 Diksmuide","confidence":"sup","surname":"Dutreeuw","family":"dutreeuw","born":"9 Nov 1781 Diksmuide","order":"1781-11-09","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"ludovica_ellebout","name":"Ludovica Prudentia Ellebout","detail":"m. Diksmuide, 27 May 1807"}],"source":"bartvanhooren (Bart Vanhooren)","note":"Son of Nicolas Dutreeuw & Therese Desramont; his wife was about sixteen years his senior."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovicus_dv","name":"Ludovicus Josephus Devriendt","dates":"","confidence":"doc","surname":"Devriendt","family":"devriendt","died":"","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"silvia_brissinck","name":"Silvia Rosalia Brissinck"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 258 — Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt × Octavia Maria Schalandrijn, Oostende, 10 November 1906; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Huwelijken (marriage index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers","note":"Named as father of the groom in his son Eugenius's 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr.\n258, S20), read as an image — the groom is \"the of-age son of the LATE Ludovicus\nJosephus Devriendt\", so he was already dead by the act date, with no date given\nthere.\n\nFRONTIER — leads from the vrijwilligersrab Huwelijken index, not read at image level,\nso not recorded as fact here: marriage to Silvia Rosalia Brissinck at Stene, 16\nFebruary 1876, act 12; his own parents, Ludovicus Devriendt x Joanna Theresia Trogh.\nEach needs the underlying act image read before it becomes a fact (verification pass,\n2026-07-26)."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovicus_p","name":"Ludovicus Paelinck","dates":"15 Jul 1660 Lochristi – 17 Apr 1720 Destelbergen","confidence":"sup","surname":"Paelinck","family":"paelinck","born":"15 Jul 1660 Lochristi","order":"1660-07-15","died":"17 Apr 1720 Destelbergen","branch":"Paelinck","line":"paelinck","father":"livinus1_p","mother":"elisabeth_t","spouses":[{"id":"petronella_v","name":"Petronella Verniers","detail":"m. Lochristi, Feb 1681"}],"source":"stefpaelinck (Stef Paelinck)","note":"Born in Lochristi (son of Livinus Paelinck & Elisabeth Temmerman); settled in Destelbergen, where he died."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"ludovicus_schal","name":"Ludovicus Franciscus Schalandryn","dates":"","confidence":"doc","surname":"Schalandryn","family":"schalandryn","occupation":"werkman (labourer)","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"mathilde_standaert","name":"Mathilde Standaert"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 258 — Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt × Octavia Maria Schalandrijn, Oostende, 10 November 1906; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Huwelijken (marriage index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Geboorten (birth index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers","note":"Named in his daughter Octavia's 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr. 258, S20), read as an\nimage, as father of the bride: \"Ludovicus Schalandrijn\", werkman, resident at Oostende\n(\"alhier wonende\"), present and consenting. The act signs him \"L. Schalandryn\"; his\ndaughter's own record spells the surname Schalandrijn, so the family name appears both\nways in the same generation and this record follows the act's own spelling of him.\n\nFRONTIER — leads from the vrijwilligersrab civil-registration indexes (Huwelijken and\nGeboorten), none read at image level, so none of the following is recorded as fact\nhere:\n\n- birth: Oudenburg, 29 January 1842 (act of 31 January 1842, nr. 14), naming his\n  parents as Ferdinandus Faustinus Schalandryn x Isabella Wallecan;\n- marriage to Mathilde Standaert: Oudenburg, 17 February 1871, act 17;\n- death: Oostende, 15 November 1916, per an Open Archives memorial card (fwk:a60b0372);\n- one generation further back, also index-only: Ferdinandus Faustinus Schalandryn's\n  parents Jacobus Schalandryn x Anna Devisschere, and Isabella Wallecan's parents\n  Henricus Wallecan x Joanna Vantornhoudt;\n- at least seven siblings of Octavia appear in the Geboorten index (rab-bs-geboorten) —\n  none are entered as records here.\n\nEach needs the underlying act image read before it becomes a fact; none is graftable\non the index alone (verification pass, 2026-07-26)."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"magdalena_demeulemeester","name":"Magdalena Demeulemeester","dates":"b. 1530–1539","confidence":"sup","surname":"Demeulemeester","family":"demeulemeester","born":"1530–1539","order":"1530","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bostyn-cappaert","father":"michiel_demeulemeester","spouses":[{"id":"willem_sabbe_o","name":"Willem Sabbe","detail":"m. ~1555"}],"source":"isavdw — Rijksarchief-sourced, with scan links","note":"Source detail: Geneanet isavdw (Sosa 27041; OSAK contracts 1560-1600)\n\nWife of Willem Sabbe (~1530). Her father is Michiel Demeulemeester."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"magdalena_vb","name":"Maria Magdalena Van Bogaert","dates":"25 Jul 1861 Nieuwkerken-Waas – 31 Dec 1928 Sint-Niklaas","confidence":"doc","surname":"Van Bogaert","family":"vanbogaert","born":"25 Jul 1861 Nieuwkerken-Waas","order":"1861-07-25","died":"31 Dec 1928 Sint-Niklaas","occupation":"huishoudster (housekeeper)","branch":"Paelinck","line":"paelinck","father":"carolus_vb","mother":"martinet","spouses":[{"id":"eduardus_p","name":"Eduardus Paelinck","detail":"m. Sint-Niklaas, 17 Nov 1888"}],"source":"Birth registration nr. 997 — Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; Birth act of Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; stefpaelinck (Stef Paelinck)","note":"Widowed young — her first husband Ludovicus Brion died in 1887 — then remarried Eduardus Paelinck in 1888. Buried at Begraafplaats Tereken, Sint-Niklaas. Daughter of Carolus Van Bogaert & Maria Martinet.\n\nCORROBORATED (July 2026) as a mother: named in her daughter Léonie's Sint-Niklaas birth\nact of 31 October 1901, alongside [[eduardus_p]].\n\nCONFIRMED BY A CIVIL RECORD (July 2026): named as the mother on her daughter's Sint-Niklaas\nbirth registration of 31 October 1901 ([[S16]]), alongside [[eduardus_p]].\n\nREGISTER PAGE READ (July 2026): named in her daughter's 1901 Sint-Niklaas birth act as\n*Maria Magdalena Van Bogaert*, **huishoudster** — an occupation this record did not carry."});
FamilyTree.person({"id":"marcel_b","name":"Marcel Henri Bundervoet","dates":"10 May 1933 Oostende – 20 Nov 2015 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Bundervoet","family":"bundervoet","born":"10 May 1933 Oostende","order":"1933-05-10","died":"20 Nov 2015 Oostende","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bundervoet","father":"alphonsus","mother":"elodia","spouses":[{"id":"rosette","name":"Rosette Van Iseghem"},{"id":"francine_bisschop","name":"Francine Bisschop"}],"source":"Familiekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial card — Marcel Bundervoet, d. Oostende 20 November 2015; The family itself","note":"Full name Marcel Henri Bundervoet. Confirmed by his memorial card, which named the Bostyn family — pointing to his mother Elodia Bostyn and father Alphonsus.\n\nDATES SHARPENED (July 2026). This record held only the years 1933 and 2015. The\nFamiliekunde Vlaanderen Westkust memorial-card index gives both in full — born\n10 May 1933 at Oostende, died 20 November 2015 at Oostende — and names both partners,\nFrancine Bisschop and a Van Iseghem, which independently confirms the two marriages the\nfamily had reported. Found by harvesting the surname from Open Archives rather than by\nsearching for him.\n\nStill `sup`: the index is a transcription of the card, and nobody here has read the card\nitself. Francine Bisschop still has no record of her own."});
