FamilyTree.person({"id":"silvia_brissinck","name":"Silvia Rosalia Brissinck","dates":"","confidence":"doc","surname":"Brissinck","family":"brissinck","occupation":"werkvrouw (working woman / labourer)","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"van-iseghem","spouses":[{"id":"ludovicus_dv","name":"Ludovicus Josephus Devriendt"}],"source":"Marriage act nr. 258 — Eugenius Alphonsius Devriendt × Octavia Maria Schalandrijn, Oostende, 10 November 1906; West-Vlaamse Burgerlijke Stand — Huwelijken (marriage index), Rijksarchief Brugge/Kortrijk volunteers","note":"Named as mother of the groom in her son Eugenius's 1906 Oostende marriage act (nr.\n258, S20), read as an image — alive, present and consenting, \"werkvrouw\", living at\nSteene, all three stated directly on the act.\n\nFRONTIER — her own parents, per the vrijwilligersrab Huwelijken index, not read at\nimage level: Joannes Franciskus Brissinck x Theresia Francisca Levecke. No specific\nact reference is held for this pass; it needs the underlying act image read before it\nbecomes a fact (verification pass, 2026-07-26)."});
