FamilyTree.person({"id":"swaelens","name":"Joannes Baptista Julianus Swaelens","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Swaelens","family":"swaelens","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"ludovica_bossin","name":"Ludovica Bossin","detail":"m. Alsemberg, 17 Feb 1884"}],"source":"Birth declarations at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe for three children of Guilielmus Bossin x Peremans, 1847-1853","note":"Married [[ludovica_bossin]] at **Alsemberg on 17 February 1884**, which makes him\n[[bossin]]'s brother-in-law.\n\nNothing else is held. The index row that names the marriage gives his three forenames and the\nbride's parents, and no date, place or parents of his own — so this record has none, rather\nthan a guess at any.\n\nFRONTIER: the Alsemberg marriage act itself, which would give his birth, his trade and his\nparents in one page."});
